"Wir verkabeln BN (braun, +24V), BU (blau, 0V) und BK (schwarz, Signal) — die genormten Farben nach IEC. Auf den FESTO-Sensor-Panels stehen die Pin-Labels in genau dieser Notation.": "We wire BN (brown, +24V), BU (blue, 0V) and BK (black, signal) — the standardised colours according to IEC. On the FESTO sensor panels the pin labels are in exactly this notation.",
